				<name type="alternate" sortindex="1" value="Mind Trap" />
			
						               													<description>Two teams try to solve logical riddles and moves on a board (which actually is a paper from a block with a "racing track"). Each time team comes up with the right solution they may move one step and demand another question or throw a die (0-3) and let the turn continue to the other team.

A sequel to the game is MindTrap II.

Contents:
406 MindTrap cards
1 playing board
2 moving pieces
2 sets of plastic sticks
(18 each)
2 sets of tangram shapes
(7 each)
1 cardholder
1 die

</description>
